5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. I hope we can maintain a peaceful and thoughtful atmosphere as we begin this game. I look forward to our conversation.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to be the best detective ever and find the werewolf right away! This is so exciting!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's keep our heads clear. Since we have no information yet, the best strategy is to observe how everyone speaks and reacts.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's nice to meet you all. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help everyone get along while we solve this.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready. Let's not waste time. I'll be watching for anyone who acts suspicious or tries to hide something.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"A measured approach is wise, Mizuki. I agree that observation is our primary tool for now.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you're so serious! Do you think the werewolf is someone who talks a lot, or someone who stays super quiet?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, it could be either. The wolf might try to lead the conversation or blend into the background. We must be vigilant.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Mizuki. It's important to be careful, but let's try to stay kind to one another.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, I don't know yet. But I'm not going to let the wolf trick me. I'll find them no matter what.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,It is interesting to see such different energies here. I shall simply listen and reflect on what is said.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,I wonder who the Seer is! They're like a superhero with X-ray vision! I hope they find something cool tonight!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,The Seer must be careful. Revealing themselves too early is a risk. We should protect them if they choose to speak.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"That's a very good point, Mizuki. Safety is important for everyone.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"If the Seer finds the wolf, they should tell us. We can't win if we're just guessing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we have established a good baseline for today. I shall retire for the evening.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to dream about clues! Goodnight everyone!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will be analyzing today's patterns. Goodnight.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Sleep well, everyone. I hope we all have a peaceful night.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
