36,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good morning. The first night has passed. I believe it is time for us to consider if any information has come to light.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! Did the Seer find anything? Please tell us! I'm dying to know!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, let's not rush them. However, if the Seer has a clear lead, it would be beneficial for the village to know.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I hope everyone slept well. I'm curious too, but let's make sure the Seer feels safe sharing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"If you know who the wolf is, just say it. Why wait and let the wolf kill more people?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I can confirm that Takumi is the werewolf. I am the Seer, and my divination was clear.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Rin,,What?! No way! Takumi is the wolf? Really?! That's so cool and scary at the same time!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, that is a very bold claim to make on the first day. If you are the Seer, this is a huge win. But if you are the wolf, you've just framed Takumi.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Oh dear, this is quite a shock. I want to believe Jonathan, but Mizuki is right to be cautious.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Takumi,,What?! You're lying! I'm not the werewolf! Jonathan is just trying to get me kicked out because he's the real wolf!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I have no reason to lie. By revealing myself and the wolf immediately, I provide the village with the fastest path to victory.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Rin,,"But Takumi looks so sad! Or maybe he's just acting? @Takumi, why are you so angry?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Takumi, your reaction is aggressive, which is typical for you, but it doesn't prove innocence. @Jonathan, why reveal yourself so early?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Midori,,"It is a difficult choice. Jonathan seems so calm and honest, but Takumi is so determined.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm angry because I'm being framed! Jonathan is the one who's acting all ""mysterious"" and ""calm"" to trick us!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,My composure is simply my nature. I trust the evidence of my vision. I suggest we vote for Takumi.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
52,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
53,1,4,talk,Rin,,I think I believe Jonathan! He's like a wise book-man! I'm voting for Takumi!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
54,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
55,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"The logic of a Seer revealing a wolf immediately is strong, even if risky. I will follow the evidence.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
56,1,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
57,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I don't want to make a mistake, but Jonathan's conviction is very strong. I'll trust him.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
